  "summary": "暑假时候去的，相隔几个月，我几乎都忘了看过些什么。不知道是不是天气缘故，那边的山景总是灰蒙蒙的，壮观是壮观，就是感觉还缺了点什么。",
  "content": "<p>暑假时候去的，相隔几个月，我几乎都忘了看过些什么。不知道是不是天气缘故，那边的山景总是灰蒙蒙的，壮观是壮观，就是感觉还缺了点什么。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_20261101_165436-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_20261101_165436-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG20260819115933-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG20260819115933-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG20260819115017-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG20260819115017-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_20261031_175539-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_20261031_175539-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261101_164609298-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261101_164609298-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_20261031_175645-scaled.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_20261031_175645-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://2cat.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261031_112153494.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\